Relevant columns & their potential usages  
• USERS."created_at": identify sign‑up time; condition → BETWEEN 1546300800000000 (2019‑01‑01) AND 1651363199000000 (2022‑04‑30 23:59:59)  
• USERS."age": needed to find youngest (MIN) & oldest (MAX) users within the date window.  
• USERS."gender": split the calculation by gender (“F”, “M”, etc.).  
• USERS."id": can be used to count distinct users that fall in the minimum / maximum age buckets.

